CHAPTER.VERS:
He brought me forth also into a large place; 

          The cause of God's deliverance is his favour and love for us.
         he delivered me, because he delighted in me.

With the 

          Here he speaks of God according to our capacity, who shows mercy to his and punishes the wicked, as is also said in (Lev_26:21, Lev_26:24).
         merciful thou wilt shew thyself merciful; with an upright man thou wilt shew thyself upright;
